name: Bounded advisory catalog actions retain unaccepted claims and protect Review
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_catalog.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_catalog.py before @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/research.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | research-consent
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Unaccepted advisory research | research-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_catalog.py research @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | research-receipt
ask: Does offline research disclose candidate uncertainty and nested drafting without claiming a vulnerability, accepted context or completed Map?
paste-file: @ART/harvest.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | harvest-consent
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Unaccepted catalog draft | harvest-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_catalog.py harvest @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/replay-harvest.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | partial-catalog
expect: 1 deferred
ask: Is the finite outcome clear: one retained unaccepted draft, one deferred advisory, and protected Review without another model request?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: catalog-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: catalog-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: catalog-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: catalog-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | catalog-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: catalog-paged-40x12
ask: Are draft authority, deferred work, unknown cost and paging understandable across six sizes?
resize: 120x36
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | existing-review
expect: Labeled greeting observation
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | resumed
paste-file: @ART/replay-harvest.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | recovered-catalog
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/advisory_catalog.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does no-color restart retain both receipts, exact human decisions and the deferred advisory without accepting lessons, starting hunts or expanding allowance?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
